WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.295
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:00.295 --> 00:00:03.295
JOHN WINSOR: The reason to build this
network organization is that we're

00:00:03.295 --> 00:00:06.050
facing a massive tech talent deficit.

00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:11.000
In 2020, the research showed
that there were 40 million

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.670
more tech jobs available
than there was talent.

00:00:13.670 --> 00:00:17.810
And it's predicted in 2025
that will jump to 150 million.

00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:21.050
So it doesn't really matter
what size organization you are.

00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:24.050
If you're a large organization
that has an amazing brand that

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:26.080
thinks they can hire any
tech talent they want,

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:28.663
or if you're a small startup
that's just struggling to get off

00:00:28.663 --> 00:00:30.920
the ground with tech
talent, every organization

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:33.095
is going to have to
put digital technology

00:00:33.095 --> 00:00:37.610
and digital tools at the center of their
organization in a post-pandemic world.

00:00:37.610 --> 00:00:42.530
We're becoming much more driven by
digital technology, and AI, and machine

00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:43.070
learning.

00:00:43.070 --> 00:00:45.545
And getting the open talent
to build the right technology

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:47.300
is really critical for
every organization.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:50.050
[MUSIC PLAYING]

